  <ferc:ReportYearPeriod id="HH6439FA2135BC4FC31DA52CEDA67ED097" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">2026/Q2</ferc:ReportYearPeriod>
  <ferc:ReportYear id="HH660FC444EE17A785BFF22BCDC6434313" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4" decimals="0" unitRef="HHferc_us_Pure">2026</ferc:ReportYear>
  <ferc:ReportPeriod id="HHBD1AFC97EAE2BF213BAE5A53CD7CEAC7" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">Q2</ferc:ReportPeriod>
  <ferc:ReportDate id="HH8FD963CECD5B15C379755C94FECA9889" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">2026-06-30</ferc:ReportDate>
  <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="HHFF9F4E3640A578CDF5DE55A091A9A0F9" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;1)None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;2)None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;3)The Company's expansion project to increase the capacity of the Gray Oak Pipeline by approximately 120,000 bpd was completed in two phases. Phase one expansion of up to 80,000 bpd was implemented effective April 1, 2025, with the corresponding initial committed rates filed in FERC Tariff No. 2.26.0 (Docket No. IS25-252) and Texas No. 3.24.0. Phase two expansion of up to 40,000 bpd was implemented effective April 1, 2026, with the corresponding initial committed rates filed in FERC Tariff No. 2.31.0 (Docket No IS26-89).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;4)The Company is involved in various litigation arising from the normal operations of its pipeline business. The Company, based on the advice of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;counsel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;, believes that any adverse findings with respect to such legal &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;actions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt; will not result in a material effect on the financial position of the Company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;5)Not Applicable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; font-size:11pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;The accompanying unaudited interim financial statements have been prepared in accordance with the accounting requirements of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (&amp;#x201C;FERC USA&amp;#x201D;), as set forth in its applicable Uniform System of Accounts and published accounting releases for quarterly reporting, which is a comprehensive basis of accounting other than accounting principles accepted in the United States of America (&amp;#x201C;GAAP&amp;#x201D;). Accordingly, they do not include all the information and footnotes required by FERC USA in the annual report. In accordance with FERC USA guidelines, prior year quarterly information is included in the FERC 6Q. In the opinion of management, they contain all adjustments, consisting only of normal recurring adjustments, which management considers necessary to present fairly the financial position as of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;June&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt; 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt; and December 31, 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;; the results of operations for the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;three and six&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt; months ended &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;June&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt; 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;June&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt; 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;, 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;; and cash flows for the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;six&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt; months ended &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;June&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt; 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;June&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;, 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;, in accordance with the accounting requirements of FERC USA. The results of operations for the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;three and six&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt; months ended &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;June&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt; 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;June&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt; 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt; should not be taken as indicative of the results to be expected for the full year, due to seasonality, maintenance activities and other factors. The interim financial statements should be read in conjunction with the financial statements and notes thereto of Gray Oak &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;Pipeline,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt; L.L.C., presented in the Form No. 6 Annual Report filed for 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Calibri"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:8pt; font-size:8pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
	&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
